Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 23:32:49 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] fix(job-offers): meet the edit and details acceptance
 criteria

- Show a success toast and return to the list after saving an edit (HU4-8).
- Use edit-specific texts in the discard, leave and error messages (HU4-9, HU4-11).
- Show a spinner on the busy step button and 44 px buttons on mobile (HU4-23, HU4-30).
- Title the details pop-up "Detalle de Vacante" with fixed header and footer (HU5-1, HU5-16).
- Share the four 2 x 2 highlight blocks between the preview and the details pop-up (HU5-3, HU5-11).
- Close the details pop-up and show a toast when it fails to load (HU5-19).
- Remove the unused published dialog from the preview step.
- Share the Google Maps validation, use cn() and theme tokens instead of fixed values.
- Stack the company portal layout on small screens.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
